  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7401.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7401.01 Applicability. This chapter applies to all emergency medical services providers licensed under Saf-C 5900 whom are authorized to function under their own licenses or through medical control.\n\nSource. #12682, EXEMPT, eff 11-28-18; ss by #13359, EXEMPT, eff 3-24-22",
